{:edb/db-before-t 2130 :edb/db-after-t 2131 :edb/tx-data [[13194139535443 50 #inst "2026-10-09T00:12:09.011Z" 13194139535443 true] [17592186068769 1020 #edb/ref 17592186349358 13194139535443 true] [17592186068772 1020 #edb/ref 17592186349351 13194139535443 true] [17592186349351 1017 #edb/ref 17592186349352 13194139535443 true] [17592186349351 1089 "q-154369" 13194139535443 true] [17592186349351 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139535443 true] [17592186349351 1100 "Find the general solution to the differential equation $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=2{e}^{-y}(x-1).$" 13194139535443 true] [17592186349351 1113 #uuid "3385e109-e3cb-5f6a-8feb-75ceb2f55ae4" 13194139535443 true] [17592186349351 1145 "To find the general solution, we first separate the variables: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =2{e}^{-y}(x-1) \\\\ {e}^{y}\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =2(x-1)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we integrate both sides with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int {e}^{y}\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}\\text{d}x & =\\int 2(x-1)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int {e}^{y}\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\cancel{\\text{d}x}}\\,\\cancel{\\text{d}x} & =\\int 2x\\,\\text{d}x-\\int 2\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ {e}^{y} & ={x}^{2}-2x+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the general solution to the differential equation (in implicit form) is\n\n$$\n{e}^{y}={x}^{2}-2x+C.\n$$" 13194139535443 true] [17592186349352 1000 #edb/ref 17592186349353 13194139535443 true] [17592186349352 1000 #edb/ref 17592186349354 13194139535443 true] [17592186349352 1000 #edb/ref 17592186349355 13194139535443 true] [17592186349352 1000 #edb/ref 17592186349356 13194139535443 true] [17592186349352 1000 #edb/ref 17592186349357 13194139535443 true] [17592186349352 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535443 true] [17592186349352 1041 "selection" 13194139535443 true] [17592186349352 1104 #edb/ref 17592186349353 13194139535443 true] [17592186349352 1110 #uuid "12dab8f4-e734-5963-9693-5c1406154eb7" 13194139535443 true] [17592186349353 1034 "{e}^{y}={x}^{2}-2x+C" 13194139535443 true] [17592186349353 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535443 true] [17592186349353 1111 #uuid "7693381a-adc8-583e-94af-eadf35214759" 13194139535443 true] [17592186349354 1034 "{e}^{2y}=\\frac{1}{2}\\,{x}^{2}-x+C" 13194139535443 true] [17592186349354 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535443 true] [17592186349354 1111 #uuid "80928768-2894-5d85-acfd-cfd9ea38e5e5" 13194139535443 true] [17592186349355 1034 "y={x}^{2}-2x+C" 13194139535443 true] [17592186349355 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535443 true] [17592186349355 1111 #uuid "f04e9899-6b36-5518-85d3-c461808ed265" 13194139535443 true] [17592186349356 1034 "{e}^{2y}={x}^{2}-2x+C" 13194139535443 true] [17592186349356 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535443 true] [17592186349356 1111 #uuid "ad191047-c971-55bb-8128-f0ada4a095ac" 13194139535443 true] [17592186349357 1034 "2y=\\frac{1}{2}\\,{x}^{2}-x+C" 13194139535443 true] [17592186349357 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535443 true] [17592186349357 1111 #uuid "bf9a5b8d-2843-51eb-8e6f-76f48f63f4fa" 13194139535443 true] [17592186349358 1017 #edb/ref 17592186349359 13194139535443 true] [17592186349358 1089 "q-158009" 13194139535443 true] [17592186349358 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139535443 true] [17592186349358 1100 "Find the general solution to the differential equation ${x}^{2}\\,{y}^{′}-y=3$ for $y\\ne -3.$" 13194139535443 true] [17592186349358 1113 #uuid "699032fa-9b2d-5062-8641-470288705407" 13194139535443 true] [17592186349358 1145 "To find the general solution, we first separate the variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}\\,{y}^{′}-y & =3 \\\\ {x}^{2}\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}-y & =3 \\\\ {x}^{2}\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =y+3 \\\\ \\frac{1}{y+3}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we integrate both sides with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{1}{y+3}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{1}{{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int \\frac{1}{y+3}\\,\\text{d}y & =\\int \\frac{1}{{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\operatorname{ln}⁡|y+3| & =-\\frac{1}{x}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the general solution to the differential equation (in implicit form) is\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{ln}⁡|y+3|=-\\frac{1}{x}+C.\n$$\n\nWe're required to write the solution in the form $y=y(x).$ By doing this, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{ln}⁡|y+3| & =-\\frac{1}{x}+C \\\\ |y+3| & ={e}^{-1/x+C} \\\\ |y+3| & ={e}^{-1/x}\\cdot {e}^{C} \\\\ |y+3| & =K{e}^{-1/x}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $K={e}^{C}$ and $K>0.$\n\nWe can drop the absolute value bars by allowing $K$ to be either positive or negative. Therefore, the most general solution is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|y+3| & =K{e}^{-1/x} \\\\ y+3 & =K{e}^{-1/x} \\\\ y & =K{e}^{-1/x}-3.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535443 true] [17592186349359 1000 #edb/ref 17592186349360 13194139535443 true] [17592186349359 1000 #edb/ref 17592186349361 13194139535443 true] [17592186349359 1000 #edb/ref 17592186349362 13194139535443 true] [17592186349359 1000 #edb/ref 17592186349363 13194139535443 true] [17592186349359 1000 #edb/ref 17592186349364 13194139535443 true] [17592186349359 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535443 true] [17592186349359 1041 "selection" 13194139535443 true] [17592186349359 1104 #edb/ref 17592186349360 13194139535443 true] [17592186349359 1110 #uuid "d3c1a1ea-775c-5824-ada6-11750b012916" 13194139535443 true] [17592186349360 1034 "y=K{e}^{-1/x}-3" 13194139535443 true] [17592186349360 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535443 true] [17592186349360 1111 #uuid "1e56dec5-b70f-5cf7-9d7d-32891777a0de" 13194139535443 true] [17592186349361 1034 "y=K{e}^{x}+3" 13194139535443 true] [17592186349361 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535443 true] [17592186349361 1111 #uuid "2d125910-295e-59ed-8a6a-e393f3053a49" 13194139535443 true] [17592186349362 1034 "y=K{e}^{1/x}+3" 13194139535443 true] [17592186349362 1103 #edb/re